        "@type": "Review",
        "reviewRating": {
          "@type": "Rating",
          "ratingValue": "5"
        },
        "reviewBody": "This loaf turned out absolutely wonderful! It tastes just like a traditional flour-based lemon loaf: moist, zesty, and lightly sweetened. I usually don't enjoy baked goods made with almond flour because of the texture, but this didn't feel like almond flour at all. I skipped the blueberries (both the extract and fresh berries) and added a few raspberries instead, and it turned out delicious. Thanks for the recipe, Craig! I'll definitely be making this again!",
        "author": {
          "@type": "Person",
          "name": "Marina"
        },
        "datePublished": "2026-07-01"
      }
